{"4622560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Roach Hotel - Chapter 2", "steam_appid": 4622560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continue on Deeper within the hotel, something worse than roaches waits. Beneath it lies a hidden hospital—where the true horrors of the Oxley Hotel begin to surface.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOTEL STORY: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the Oxley Hotel, you awaken deeper within its dark halls, where the truth behind its dark, rotting heart begins to spread. The walls feel alive. The shadows linger  longas you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the remaining survivors and yourself to uncover what has twisted the cockroaches into something far more aggressive… and far more worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it’s not just roaches you’re facing anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your sister and uncover the  secrets buried beneath the Oxley Hotel. Discover what truly began this nightmare, but only if you step inside. Are you brave enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allies:</strong> Help Dr. Eddie and Katie to find away to stop the the real nightmare that started the chaos, &quot;The Male&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creations:</strong> Find ways to upgrade and create objects around the area that can be useful to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBJECTS:</strong> Deeper below, more horrific designs await. The company known as “Virex Development Group” has created something twisted. Something unnatural. What could be worse than bugs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or were they ever bugs to begin with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/19f15fce2e821a8858fc8c95c5bfb49a.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/19f15fce2e821a8858fc8c95c5bfb49a.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/19f15fce2e821a8858fc8c95c5bfb49a.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/003c5ac02c9d340a167f893b2ac8db96.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/003c5ac02c9d340a167f893b2ac8db96.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/003c5ac02c9d340a167f893b2ac8db96.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHERE IS YOUR SISTER?:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Lauren still missing, there’s a chance she’s alive, somewhere in the dark, hiding, afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to press on… and bring her back safely, no matter what’s waiting ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continue on Deeper within the hotel, something worse than roaches waits. Beneath it lies a hidden hospital—where the true horrors of the Oxley Hotel begin to surface.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOTEL STORY: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the Oxley Hotel, you awaken deeper within its dark halls, where the truth behind its dark, rotting heart begins to spread. The walls feel alive. The shadows linger  longas you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the remaining survivors and yourself to uncover what has twisted the cockroaches into something far more aggressive… and far more worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it’s not just roaches you’re facing anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your sister and uncover the  secrets buried beneath the Oxley Hotel. Discover what truly began this nightmare, but only if you step inside. Are you brave enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allies:</strong> Help Dr. Eddie and Katie to find away to stop the the real nightmare that started the chaos, &quot;The Male&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/9b6a999da40dd50b24fa9ebadfd89757.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creations:</strong> Find ways to upgrade and create objects around the area that can be useful to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.poster.avif?t=1784528476\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.webm?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4622560/extras/c64330c0208f80187a168a61bbd12452.mp4?t=1784528476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBJECTS:</strong> Deeper below, more horrific designs await. The company known as “Virex Development Group” has created something twisted. Somethi